{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_106_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_106","textTraditional":"一、十年，春王三月辛卯，臧孫辰卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_106_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_106","textTraditional":"二、夏，秦伐晉。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_106_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_106","textTraditional":"三、楚殺其大夫宣申。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_106_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_106","textTraditional":"四、自正月不雨，至于秋七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_106_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_106","textTraditional":"五、及蘇子盟于女栗。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_106_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_106","textTraditional":"六、冬，狄侵宋。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_106_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_106","textTraditional":"七、楚子、蔡侯次于屈貉。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}